WEBVTT

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.070
How are you doing?

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:42.200
You're looking healthier.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:47.440
<i>The pain that leads to happiness... huh?</i>

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.050
Oh, yeah! This is kinda
out of left field,

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:54.050
but something really funny
happened at school today!

00:01:57.190 --> 00:01:59.720
Well, I'll see you later, Kaminagi.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.460
Thank you, Sempai.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.230
For finding Kaminagi.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.830
Oh. That's right. Sempai!

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.540
Let's go to the summer festival
together this time around.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.340
Kyo.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.480
All right! Perfect!

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.520
It's Minato. I'm coming in, sir.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.520
Um... I just baked a batch of cookies.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.760
If you like, could you?

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.220
Wha?

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:00.890
Abyss!

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:07.050
Why do they fight?
They who lack the light...

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.820
Even though they have no future.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.600
The lightless ones lack
the skill to regain the light.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:18.770
They will never become like us,
who possess it.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:21.670
And yet, why do they fight on?

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.400
Sin is Abyss. Abyss is Sin.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.520
Whatever Abyss doesn't understand,
Sin does not understand, either.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.520
But I know someone who does know!
She <i>must</i> know!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:10.520
<i>Nice job on that</i>
<i>scheduled recon mission.</i>

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.430
The president's not here?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.360
Oh! Welcome back!

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.800
Well, then where'd he go?

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:22.240
I don't know. He's treating it as
top secret. He didn't even tell me.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.400
That's unusual, huh?
Him going out alone.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.870
He's not alone.
He took Shizuno Misaki with him.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.280
Sempai, too?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.990
Now that you mention it, those two
disappear together every once in a while.

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:39.720
And the intervals between their
disappearances have been getting shorter, too.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.190
That sounds...

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:43.090
...kinda suspicious, huh?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.500
I see.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.560
Well, if he's not here, he's not here.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.530
I wanted to ask him
about Kaminagi, though.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.870
I can already guess
what you're thinking about.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:59.630
Can't we just keep Kaminagi
transferred inside of the Zega, right?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.500
We've concluded that it's impossible.

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:04.050
Why?!

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:08.310
If we just keep her meta-body data downloaded
into the Zega, we'll end up losing it.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.150
If we keep her
in there for too long,

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:14.250
then we'll lose her
for good next time.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.660
I know how you feel,
but just let it go.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.830
We'll do what we can to help, too.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.560
Let's try to think of another way, okay?

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.370
I'm sorry, Yehl. Making you
accompany me all the time.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.830
It can't be helped.
There's no one else you can ask.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.280
Is there something you want to say to me?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:38.910
Nothing, sir.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.860
We've got a 90 minute recon today.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.370
They've increased the
Zega's operational time!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:02.030
That means I get to spend
more time with you, Kyo!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:04.510
Yeah, that's right.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.210
Thank you, Kyo.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:09.370
For always bringing me those pretty flowers.
I can see them, you know.

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:10.810
Sure.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:15.350
And also... I can always hear you, too.
Your voice.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.110
Yeah, I know!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.020
I'm opening her up, Kaminagi!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:27.760
Currently, Cerebrum knows of eleven
quantum servers on the human side.

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:30.670
Number of meta-bodies
preserved: three thousand.

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.900
Current combat strength: eight carriers.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:37.010
Number of holonic loaders: 42,
with the Zegapain forming our main force.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:39.070
Number of Cerebrants: 68.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.240
There were once over
300 servers around the world.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.240
And now we're down to just 11?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.720
Over the last two months,
we've lost three servers,

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:49.250
approximately 650 meta-bodies,

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:52.090
and 18 Cerebrants.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.990
And comparing that to the
Gards-orm's combat strength?

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:59.630
We're still calculating that, but with
the appearance of the Anti-Zega,

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.930
and taking the speed of their
weapons development into account...

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.400
We're obviously outnumbered.
That's it, isn't it?

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:10.310
What's wrong?!

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:13.210
The Altair has encountered a
Gards-orm mobile squadron!

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:14.510
They're under attack!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.310
What?!

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.680
Order the Garuda and Hraesvelg
to scramble at once!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.720
There! There! I've found you!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:35.900
What's the big idea?! I barely get
any time with Kaminagi as it is!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:39.760
Kyo, this is hardly the time to
be saying that! Here we go!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.640
Shifting to combat mode!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.830
Holonic field, forming! Holonic lancer, right hand!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.680
What's the holdup?!
Give us launch clearance, already!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.590
<i>Wait! Something's strange.</i>

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:57.520
Strange?

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:01.320
<i>Kobrals are assault units,</i>
<i>not used for recon or patrols.</i>

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.980
So... You think it's a diversion? But...

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:09.160
<i>With the commander absent,</i>
<i>my duty is to protect this ship!</i>

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.130
<i>Anyway, just stand by for now!</i>

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:11.830
Roger.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.210
What the hell?! They're fast!

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.140
Keep cool, Kyo!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:37.790
Kaminagi!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.280
Fast-forming our shields!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.600
Kyo! Above us!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:47.270
What?!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.770
I gotcha now!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.850
It won't let go! Kaminagi!

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.180
Roger! Holo-Blade Sparrow!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:14.160
It's running? Feels too soon, though...

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.970
We're out of Q.L.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.330
Looks like our conversation's been interrupted.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.340
Oh, well. Shall we head home?

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.210
Yeah. We'll continue tomorrow.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.320
Now what?!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.490
Something's transmitted with the Altair!

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.790
Define "something!"

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.410
This is!
There's a Gards-orm aboard!

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.090
What did you say?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.670
The Gards-orm, here on the Oceanus?!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.820
Are they serious?! How did this happen?!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.390
K- Kyo...

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:11.080
What's wrong, Kaminagi?

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.590
It's here!

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.300
Lightless ones.

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:31.270
Why, you!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.410
Dammit! That thing's flesh and blood!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.380
Lightless ones.

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:48.810
Sin!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.560
I see no light.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.490
Lu-shen, no! What if she has a bomb?!

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:01.040
Kaminagi, you get back to Maihama!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.110
But!

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:04.160
Never mind, just go!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.340
Kyo...

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:12.620
Initiate Q.L. charge.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.650
<i>Power reactor bulkheads, sealed!</i>

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:20.150
<i>Mainframe core bulkheads, sealed!</i>

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:24.820
No weapons or bombs
detected on Reconstructant.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:28.130
I see. Then what's its objective here?

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:31.190
And how could an unprotected living
creature survive quantum transmission?!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:35.860
Well... Maybe it could
because it's a Reconstructant.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:40.610
Living creatures can't normally
withstand quantum transmission.

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:43.810
Maybe they can do it
because they've evolved to.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.080
It completely took advantage
of a blind spot in our systems.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.280
Who would've guessed it'd grab
onto the Zega and ride it in here!

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.790
What do we do, Miss Vice-president?!

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:56.190
Meta-bodies are useless
against a living enemy!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.220
I know!

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:59.730
Where is it now?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:02.430
Moving from B block to D block.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:03.920
Activating on board security systems.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.830
So, this is a ship of the lightless ones.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.000
It looks just like our ships.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:21.210
B block's security systems
have been destroyed!

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.980
Beam weaponry is having no effect!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.620
Seriously?! That thing's unkillable?!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.880
It can't be. Even a Reconstructant
is still a living thing!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.590
Reconstructant has penetrated D block!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.500
Seal off D block!
Activate fire suppression systems!

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:40.430
We'll use the oxygen absorbent
to asphyxiate it!

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:55.890
What the?

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.940
Oxygen level dropping rapidly!

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.650
All right, it's working!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:06.750
What's wrong?!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.170
The Reconstructant has entered our systems!

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:11.470
It's forcing our bulkheads to open up!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.300
Impossible!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.290
It can do that, too?!

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.470
It's acting just like...

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.100
a Cerebrant!

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.570
Reconstructant has resumed its movement.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:23.480
Where is it headed?!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.310
Extrapolating path!

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:28.180
Here! It's headed for the bridge!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.950
It's trying to steal the Oceanus?

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.620
Captain! Emergency lock down of the bridge!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.260
Roger!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.570
Reconstructant, arriving!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.570
Here... She's here!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.620
Hey, are we all right in here?

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:04.520
Unlike the bulkheads, it's impossible
to open the bridge during a lock down.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:07.590
Its physical abilities may be
greater than a human's,

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.020
but it'd be impossible
for it to destroy that door.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:15.960
What the hell?

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.470
Sin!

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:20.730
How did it get in?!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.540
It's not a physical body!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.610
Reconstructants can...
They can become meta-bodies, too?!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.700
She's not here. Why not?

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.660
I thought she'd be here.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:51.970
Vice-president!

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:52.940
Where is she?!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.470
Where is she?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.740
Where is Yehl?!

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:02.880
Yehl?!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.040
What do you want with Shizuno-sempai?!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.270
Where is Yehl?!

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:10.210
Not... Not here!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.980
I see.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.790
Then I will ask you.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.690
Why do you lightless ones fight us?

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.970
I can annihilate you
without a second thought.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:32.570
Now, tell me. Why do you fight?!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:38.040
Isn't it obvious?
We're fighting to survive!

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.130
And why do you fight?

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.960
Why, you!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.300
Tell me why!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.810
Why do <i>you</i> fight <i>us?!</i>

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.240
Why are you changing the world?!

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.080
And why do you fight?

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:22.960
Fosetta!

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:23.790
Right!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.320
Why, when you have no future?

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.990
You're the ones who stole it from us!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:33.100
One day, I'll destroy you!
Be ready for that day!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:46.680
You?!

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:54.280
I hate you! Now, disappear!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.770
Are you okay?

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:11.140
Yeah. But why did she come here?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.370
Where is the Reconstructant?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:18.310
Fosetta's destruction has
damaged our on board sensors.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:22.710
Fosetta won't be fully reinstalled
for another 3 minutes, 25 seconds.

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:23.650
Hurry!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:38.220
Okay, the Q.L. charge is complete.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.160
Now we can go out at any time.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:52.440
Um... Excuse me.
Are you all right? Are you in pain?

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.280
Tell me!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:58.840
Why... do you people... fight us?

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:04.180
Tell me! Tell me, please!
That's why I came here.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.330
Well...

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.130
Tell me!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:12.940
It's because... I don't want to lose them.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.100
I want to protect them.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.770
The things which can never be replaced.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.700
Things which can never be... replaced?

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.100
Y... Yeah.

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:30.280
I have that! Sin has that, too!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.420
You're a good person.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.090
A lightless one, but Sin still likes you.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.430
Still, there's something strange about you.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.270
Your structure is odd.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.960
You lack something, don't you?

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:49.130
Since you're a good person...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.440
I'll do this for you.

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.070
Kaminagi!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.990
You aren't lacking anymore.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.510
I'm sure you'll like that form.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.660
Go to hell, Sin!

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.140
Kobral, approaching!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.110
Fire antiaircraft guns!

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:32.650
Hey! Kaminagi! Wake up!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.350
Kyo...

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:40.950
I think... she did something to me...

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.320
Kaminagi!

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:52.330
Abyss!

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:03.350
I understand, Abyss.

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:06.440
I understand why
the lightless ones fight us.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.710
So they won't lose them...
So they can protect them...

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.510
The things that cannot be replaced...

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:22.560
I see. That's why I don't understand.

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:27.670
As we evolved to gain the light,
we lost that in the process.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:32.070
There is nothing we can ever lose.

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:36.640
No... Not even our lives.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.420
What's wrong? What happened here?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.510
There's nothing to worry about, Commander.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:46.050
The danger has been averted.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.670
What? What is it?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.600
A friend of yours came to visit...

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.330
Yehl.

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:53.420
Ryoko has been restored.

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:57.720
However, her emotional data still
remains trapped in the Altair.

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.760
Kyo Sogoru must confront a new problem.

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:04.490
Those who live in the Maihama
server and the Cerebrants like him.

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:06.530
Which ones can he call "real?"

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:09.360
Is everyone fake? Is anyone real?

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.590
Only a single flower knows for sure.

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:16.370
Next time, on Zegapain:
"With False Wounds, Pain Withers."

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:18.840
My pain, never to be forgotten.
